---
description: Loyalty program rules for the 7Oz Espresso Cafe platform.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Loyalty Program

Loyalty points represent customer rewards.

Points are financial-like values.

Protect them accordingly.

---

# Point Calculation

Never calculate loyalty points in frontend.

Always calculate in backend.

---

# Point Source

Examples:

Purchase

Promotion

Manual Adjustment

Birthday Reward

Referral

Campaign

---

# Redemption

Point redemption must validate:

Available Balance

Reward Availability

Expiration Rules

Business Rules

---

# Point History

Every point movement must create a history record.

Earn

Redeem

Adjustment

Expired

Bonus

---

# Negative Balance

Never allow negative point balances.

---

# Expiration

Support configurable expiration rules.

---

# Rewards

Rewards should be configurable.

Examples:

Free Coffee

Free Pastry

Discount Voucher

Merchandise

Special Event Access

---

# Fraud Prevention

Prevent duplicate redemption.

Prevent concurrent redemption race conditions.

Log every transaction.

---

# Future Ready

Partner Rewards

Campaign Multipliers

Seasonal Promotions

Multi-branch Rewards